This project is a port. The panel's layout, its choice of readings, and the
data-collection logic were derived from Omarchy's network panel:

    shell/plugins/panels/network/{Panel.qml,Model.js}
    bin/omarchy-network-{status,band,qr,password,speedtest}

Omarchy is MIT-licensed, and its notice is reproduced below in full as that
license requires. Several comments in src/net.rs and src/model.rs are quoted or
adapted from the Omarchy sources they were ported from.

Omarchy — https://github.com/omacom/omarchy

